                  {
                    "$kind": "binding",
                    "select": {
                      "from": "answers",
                      "path": "instruction"
                    }
                  },
                  "\n\nHere is the current board (one note per line):\n",
                  {
                    "$kind": "binding",
                    "select": {
                      "from": "typed",
                      "path": "text"
                    }
                  },
                  "\n\nReturn the COMPLETE desired board as a JSON array of notes \u2014 each element an object like {\"text\": \"the note text\"}. Reorganize and improve it: rewrite weak or empty/placeholder notes into strong concrete goals, keep the good ones, and add a few excellent example goals if the board is sparse. Return ONLY the JSON array, nothing else."
